tic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Necrotic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">Necrotic</span></a>.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715035528\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.073 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.076 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3238/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 57040/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 20101/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 23/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 34/1000\nLua time usage: 0.018/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1372101/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   60.321      1 Template:Feature_page\n100.00%   60.321      1 -total\n 93.09%   56.150     58 Template:Trim\n 25.79%   15.559      9 Template:Icon_text\n 19.17%   11.562      1 Template:Feature_page/technical_section\n 14.39%    8.679      4 Template:Icon_link\n 12.70%    7.658      1 Template:Resource\n 10.14%    6.117      2 Template:Hidden_code\n  9.27%    5.592      1 Template:Main_namespace_only\n  7.83%    4.720      2 Template:DamageText\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:23183-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715035528 and revi